1389	        "If the user message ends with "
1390	        "[mentioned_users: name=open_id], "
1391	        "use those open_ids when you need to @mention or remind "
1392	        "those users. Do NOT include the [mentioned_users: ...] "
1393	        "block in your reply text.\n",
1394	        channel, chat_id);
