693	 * NOT emoji (U+1F000..) or dingbats — those show as tofu boxes, and worse,
694	 * MiMo TTS reads them aloud as a stray "think"-like word.  Walk the UTF-8
695	 * string in place and drop any emoji code point (plus the variation-selector
696	 * and zero-width-joiner bytes that make up emoji sequences). */
