1167		/* Force the DAPM route (DAC analog enables + external speaker PA) to
1168		 * re-run on EVERY open. A previous close should set dapm_state back to
1169		 * 0, but if any path leaves it stuck at 1 the next prepare's
1170		 * dapm_control(1) short-circuits and the analog path stays off — the
1171		 * symptom is "only the first reply is audible". Resetting here is
