563	/* The MiMo endpoint (token-plan-cn.xiaomimimo.com, a Xiaomi ALB) intermittently
564	 * fails fresh handshakes during backend rotation: the server goes silent
565	 * (recv timeout), serves a cert this build can't parse, or sends an invalid
566	 * record — all transient, and the same host works moments later. Retry with
567	 * exponential backoff so a slow rotation isn't exhausted by the fixed 200ms
568	 * gap; tls_ctx_connect() already iterates every resolved IP per attempt. */
