   `install_builtin()` (line 250) rewrites each `.md` on every boot via `snprintf(path, sizeof(path), "%s%s.md", AGENT_SKILLS_DIR, skill->filename);` — deliberate ("Built-in skills are the curated source of truth").

   **NEW: `/home/ubuntu/packages/ai_agent/src/core/context_builder.c` — every append is unclamped:**
