2535	        /* A separate flat bar for a fully shut eye. This exists because the
2536	         * open eye cannot be squashed to nothing without driving its height
2537	         * (and therefore its effective radius) below the cache-friendly
2538	         * minimum -- and because a rounded rect at height 0 draws nothing at
